ical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, to write the equation of the hyperbola in standard form, we need to divide both sides of the equation by $108$ and then simplify, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2} & =108 \\\\ \\frac{9{y}^{2}}{108}-\\frac{4{x}^{2}}{108} & =\\frac{108}{108} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{12}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{27} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5f421af2-f261-541c-b240-6ea8585fdaac"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5f421af2-f261-541c-b240-6ea8585fdaac" :answer-field/id #uuid "5f421af2-f261-541c-b240-6ea8585fdaac" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-cf474a1b-1bba-5cf6-bc61-cab862359514" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cf474a1b-1bba-5cf6-bc61-cab862359514"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cf474a1b-1bba-5cf6-bc61-cab862359514" :answer/id #uuid "cf474a1b-1bba-5cf6-bc61-cab862359514" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y^{2}}{12}-\\frac{x^{2}}{27}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-baf78baa-496d-5dd9-b863-2a6a8261b98f" :activity/id #uuid "baf78baa-496d-5dd9-b863-2a6a8261b98f" :activity/title "Equations of Hyperbolas Centered at the Origin" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049233 :activity/course 17592186046658 :activity/steps ["step-f0a8096e-17af-5af4-b791-6c7ebea90cbf" "step-ddbeef6a-54e8-5857-a215-c8cb4f0e69b3" "step-b2519ce3-45c8-5f31-b559-0f092eaad457" "step-c38b8768-3860-5d20-89b3-37d82e581361" "step-f43c18de-fd32-5b5e-bba7-c5ee3c9b06e4"] :activity/first-step "step-f0a8096e-17af-5af4-b791-6c7ebea90cbf" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-f0a8096e-17af-5af4-b791-6c7ebea90cbf" :step/id #uuid "f0a8096e-17af-5af4-b791-6c7ebea90cbf" :step/content "question-a21adcc1-3b87-5d19-b775-6ef90961f595" :step/next "ste